### ------------------------------------------------------------
### Contacts API - REST Client test file
### Use the "Send Request" link above each request (VS Code REST Client)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

@localUrl = http://localhost:8081
@renderUrl = https://cse341-003-web-services.onrender.com

### ===================== LOCAL =====================

### Get all contacts (local)
GET {{localUrl}}/contacts

### Get contact by id (local) - replace the id with a real _id from MongoDB
GET {{localUrl}}/contacts/66f9a1b2c3d4e5f607182930

### Create a new contact (local) - returns the new contact id
POST {{localUrl}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "email": "ana.silva@test.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Blue",
  "birthday": "1995-04-12"
}

### Update a contact (local) - replace the id with the one returned by POST
PUT {{localUrl}}/contacts/66f9a1b2c3d4e5f607182930
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Santos",
  "email": "ana.santos@test.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Green",
  "birthday": "1995-04-12"
}

### Delete a contact (local)
DELETE {{localUrl}}/contacts/66f9a1b2c3d4e5f607182930

### ===================== RENDER =====================

### Get all contacts (Render)
GET {{renderUrl}}/contacts

### Get contact by id (Render) - replace the id with a real _id from MongoDB
GET {{renderUrl}}/contacts/66f9a1b2c3d4e5f607182930

### Create a new contact (Render) - returns the new contact id
POST {{renderUrl}}/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Silva",
  "email": "ana.silva@test.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Blue",
  "birthday": "1995-04-12"
}

### Update a contact (Render) - replace the id with the one returned by POST
PUT {{renderUrl}}/contacts/66f9a1b2c3d4e5f607182930
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ana",
  "lastName": "Santos",
  "email": "ana.santos@test.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Green",
  "birthday": "1995-04-12"
}

### Delete a contact (Render)
DELETE {{renderUrl}}/contacts/66f9a1b2c3d4e5f607182930